{"t":"047810.KS","n":"Korea Aerospace Industries, Ltd.","nKo":"한국항공우주산업","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":99800.0,"chg":6700.0,"chgPct":0.07197,"prev":93100.0,"dayH":100300.0,"dayL":94200.0,"w52H":215500.0,"w52L":93100.0,"vol":227780,"avgVol":256857,"mcap":9728014942208,"pe":null,"fpe":23.4,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":500.0,"divY":0.0054,"beta":0.74,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Aerospace & Defense","iKo":"항공우주 및 방위","city":"Sacheon-si","emp":null,"web":"https://www.koreaaero.com","sum":"Korea Aerospace Industries, Ltd. develops, manufactures, and sells fixed-wing and rotary-wing aircraft, unmanned aerial vehicles, satellites, launch vehicles, and aerospace components in South Korea and internationally. The company offers trainer aircraft, fighter aircraft, helicopters, satellite and space systems, simulators, and aircraft structures for commercial aerospace applications. It also provides aircraft maintenance, repair and overhaul services, as well as satellite communication components, avionics, testing equipment, and other aerospace-related products and services. Korea Aerospace Industries, Ltd. was founded in 1999 and is headquartered in Sacheon-si, South Korea.","sumKo":"한국항공우주산업(주)는 고정익 및 회전익 항공기, 무인항공기, 위성, 발사체, 항공우주 부품을 국내외에서 개발, 제조, 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 상업용 항공우주 응용 분야를 위한 훈련기, 전투기, 헬리콥터, 위성 및 우주 시스템, 시뮬레이터 및 항공기 구조물을 제공합니다. 또한 항공기 유지보수, 수리 및 정비 서비스는 물론 위성 통신 부품, 항공전자공학, 테스트 장비, 기타 항공우주 관련 제품 및 서비스도 제공합니다. 한국항공우주산업(주)는 1999년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 사천시에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":2786888280000,"ni":118462750000},{"y":2023,"rev":3819344380000,"ni":221844420000},{"y":2024,"rev":3633700000000,"ni":172100000000},{"y":2025,"rev":3696400000000,"ni":185900000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":1466700000000,"ni":60600000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":1092700000000,"ni":42000000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":1167900000000,"ni":35900000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":1064300000000,"